No legal text is held in this repository.

The facts in `legal-system` come from Wikidata, released under CC0 1.0 Universal (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).
The treaty actions in `treaties` are facts (treaty, action, date, depositary) taken from the UN Treaty Collection (https://treaties.un.org/); no treaty text or descriptive text is copied.

The catalogue and wipo-treaties facts (titles, subjects, dates, administering organisation, links) come from WIPO Lex, https://www.wipo.int/wipolex/, retrieved 30 October 2026, whose content is published under CC BY 4.0 (https://www.wipo.int/web/terms-of-use). Only facts are copied; no descriptive text and no law or treaty text. Source: World Intellectual Property Organization. Changes made by Lexifina: records were turned into one Markdown file per record, with the dates arranged as a git history. WIPO does not endorse this repository.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the
tools) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
